@startuml Bidding Workflow - Activity Diagram

title Bidding Workflow - Activity Diagram

|#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
start
:View auction details;

:Enter bid amount;

:Submit bid request;

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Validate auction exists;

if (Auction found?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Check auction status is active;

if (Auction active?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return "Auction not active";
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Check auction end time;

if (Auction ended?) then (Yes)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return "Auction ended";
  stop
else (No)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Validate bid amount:
amount > current bid
AND amount >= starting bid;

if (Bid valid?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return "Bid too low";
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Create bid record in database;

:Update auction:
- Set current bid = bid amount
- Increment bid count;

:Get bidder name;

:Cache bid in Redis:
- Add to bid history
- Update highest bid;

:Broadcast bid via SignalR
to all connected clients;

:Process auto bids
(if any other buyers have auto bid);

|#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
:Bid placed successfully;
stop

@enduml

